@alxwlw/oxlint-config

The presets and the `stack` JS plugin in this package originate in a private
package owned by the same author. It carried no licence declaration; it is
published here under this repository's MIT licence with the author's consent.

rules/require-nest-di-decorator.js was, upstream, kept byte-identical to a
sibling ESLint rule by a lockstep test that does NOT travel with this copy.
The two will drift; this copy is authoritative here.

rules/vendor/simple-import-sort/ is eslint-plugin-simple-import-sort 14.0.0
(https://github.com/lydell/eslint-plugin-simple-import-sort, MIT, see LICENSE there),
copied verbatim except that require() paths carry the .cjs extension. Vendored so the
package's `eslint` peer dependency does not reach consumers. Upgrade by re-copying.
